1795344277876	{"id":{"$t":"tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-8657703664257880060.post-2654311952474234638"},"published":{"$t":"2026-11-22T05:44:37.876-05:00"},"updated":{"$t":"2026-11-22T05:44:37.876-05:00"},"category":[{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Articles"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"History"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"lang-ne"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Nepali"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"pair-sumer8"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"series-sumer"}],"title":{"type":"text","$t":"सुमेरको पतन"},"summary":{"type":"text","$t":"विलाप र भग्नावशेष: खडेरी, आक्रमण र फेरिँदो नदीधारले कसरी विश्वको पहिलो सभ्यतालाई अस्ताचलतिर पुर्‍यायो एकताका भव्य मन्दिरहरू र मानव इतिहासकै पहिलो लिपिका अक्षरहरूले धपधपी बलेका सुमेरका सहरहरू अन्ततः खडेरी, बाह्य आक्रमण र समयको भारीले थिचिएर ओइलाउँदै गए। तिनका भग्नावशेषमा आज पनि एउटा त्यस्तो जातिको प्रतिध्वनि अल्झिरहेकै छ—जसले हामीलाई सभ्यताको पहिलो बिहानी दियो, तर आफैँ भने त्यसको सबैभन्दा सुरुवाती "},"link":[{"rel":"replies","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https://www.kafka.blog/feeds/2654311952474234638/comments/default","title":"Post Comments"},{"rel":"replies","type":"text/html","href":"https://www.kafka.blog/2026/11/sumerko-patan-bilap-ra-bhagnawashesh.html#comment-form","title":"0 Comments"},{"rel":"edit","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https://www.blogger.com/feeds/8657703664257880060/posts/default/2654311952474234638"},{"rel":"self","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https://www.blogger.com/feeds/8657703664257880060/posts/default/2654311952474234638"},{"rel":"alternate","type":"text/html","href":"https://www.kafka.blog/2026/11/sumerko-patan-bilap-ra-bhagnawashesh.html","title":"सुमेरको पतन"}],"author":[{"name":{"$t":"Unknown"},"email":{"$t":"noreply@blogger.com"},"gd$image":{"rel":"http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail","width":"16","height":"16","src":"https://img1.blogblog.com/img/b1